OL,3,GNEWSAWaste tipped onto road after
OL,4,Acatching fire in lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe contents of a bin lorry was tipped
OL,7,Fonto a road in Worthing on Friday
OL,8,Fmorning after catching fire.
OL,10,FWest Sussex Fire & Rescue Service said
OL,11,Fit sent two fire engines to The
OL,12,FCauseway at 09:40 GMT to reports of a
OL,13,Florry fire.
OL,15,FCrews arrived to find the fire was
OL,16,Falready out. They carried out a thermal
OL,17,Fsurvey to ensure there were no hotspots
OL,18,Fin the waste before leaving the scene
OL,19,Fat about 10:00.
OL,21,FWorkers then began clearing the waste
OL,22,Ffrom the road.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
